        "original_id": "577f3bb9-a598-5344-85ff-5c0fff0870ae",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kristin Davis, Darren Star, Brooke Shields\n- Works: Melrose Place, Sex and the City, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, Harvest Time Hop and Fly\n- Companies: HBO\n- Topics: American television, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Kristin Davis, also listed as Kristin Lee Davis, was born on February 23, 1965, and is an American actress.\n- Sex and the City was an American romantic comedy television series created by Darren Star and produced by HBO.\n- Sex and the City aired from 1998 to 2004 and had 94 episodes in its original run.\n- Kristin Davis played Brooke Armstrong on Melrose Place from 1995 to 1996.\n- Kristin Davis played Charlotte York Goldenblatt on HBO's Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids featured Brooke Shields as the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends spun off from Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids and featured Kristin Davis as the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Harvest Time Hop and Fly was a Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends video game.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
